---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Section from '../../components/layout/Section.astro';
import Container from '../../components/layout/Container.astro';
import { FALLBACK_EMAIL } from '../../utils/forms/submit';
const mailto = 'mailto:' + FALLBACK_EMAIL;
const lastUpdated = '18 August 2026';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Marlbridge collects, uses and protects personal information."
  path="/legal/privacy/"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  headingFont="sans"
  lead={`Last updated ${lastUpdated}.`}
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy', href: '/legal/privacy/' }]}
>
  <Section surface="white">
    <Container width="prose">
      <div class="text-[17.5px] leading-[1.75] [&>h2]:mt-10 [&>h2]:text-[26px] [&>h2]:font-semibold [&>h2]:text-navy-800 [&>h3]:mt-8 [&>h3]:text-[20px] [&>h3]:font-semibold [&>p]:mt-5 [&>ul]:mt-5 [&>ul]:ps-5 [&>ul>li]:mt-2">
        <p class="m-0 border-s-2 border-gold-500 ps-4 text-[15.5px] text-ink-mute">
          This is a general privacy notice covering how Marlbridge currently handles personal information. It has not been reviewed by a lawyer. If you need a policy for a specific regulatory regime, have it checked before relying on it.
        </p>

        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Marlbridge is an education platform operated by Learners Academy, based in Pakistan. For any question
          about this policy or your personal information, write to <a href={mailto} class="underline decoration-gold-500 underline-offset-2">{FALLBACK_EMAIL}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>When you submit an enquiry through our contact form, we collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your name and email address</li>
          <li>Your phone number, if you provide one</li>
          <li>Your country</li>
          <li>The program and subject you're asking about, if selected</li>
          <li>The message you write</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not collect payment information, government ID numbers, or other sensitive personal data through
          the website.
        </p>

        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          Our web pages are static. We use Google Analytics (GA4) to understand how visitors use the site, but
          only if you accept the cookie banner shown on your first visit — no analytics data is collected before
          you accept, and none is collected at all if you reject or ignore the banner. When enabled, GA4 records
          things like which pages are viewed and how visitors arrive at the site, with IP anonymisation turned
          on. We do not run advertising trackers. The enquiry form also uses Cloudflare Turnstile to filter out
          automated spam submissions, which runs regardless of your analytics choice. Loading fonts from Google
          Fonts causes your browser to make a request to Google's servers, which may log your IP address under
          Google's own privacy policy. See our <a href="/legal/cookies/" class="underline decoration-gold-500 underline-offset-2">Cookie Policy</a> for more detail.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>
          We use the information you submit only to respond to your enquiry — to understand what you or your
          learner needs and to get back to you. We do not sell, rent, or share your information with third
          parties for marketing purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>Enquiries involving a minor</h2>
        <p>
          Many of our learners are under 18. Where an enquiry concerns a minor, we expect it to be submitted by,
          or with the knowledge of, a parent or guardian. Please don't include more information about a minor
          than is needed to respond to your enquiry.
        </p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          We keep enquiry information for as long as reasonably needed to respond and follow up, and delete or
          anonymise it once it's no longer needed for that purpose.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it, by
          writing to <a href={mailto} class="underline decoration-gold-500 underline-offset-2">{FALLBACK_EMAIL}</a>. We will respond directly.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          If how we handle personal information changes materially — for example, if we start using a CRM tool
          or change our analytics provider — we will update this page and the date above.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </Section>
</PageLayout>
